        "quote": "(a) It shall be unlawful to fail to remove stored personal property located in areas identified in TMC 9.45.360 within 24 hours of receiving written notice pursuant to this section.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.370:block:0#text",
